      "title": "METHODOLOGY AND REASONING",
      "subsection": "Methodology: Reasoning",
      "body": "- Stage 1, geometry: CadQuery CAD of both skins\n- Stage 2, setup: SPARTA, 5-species air, VSS collisions\n- Stage 3, simulation: particles through advection, collisions, surfaces\n- Stage 4, validation: grid independence, Sutton-Graves, IRVE-3\n- Stage 5, optimization: a GA with tournament and elitism\n- Reasoning: scalloped skin against a smooth one, same condition",
      "target_position": "immediately after PLACEHOLDER 2.",
      "note": "Filled from the thesis. The narration is taken from the thesis chapters named in the figure source line, and the graphic is imported from the thesis figure archive.",
