      "title": "METHODOLOGY: THE COST FUNCTION",
      "subsection": "Methodology: Optimization Pipeline",
      "body": "- The cost is analytic: evaluating it needs no solver call\n- Four dimensionless terms: heat load, stagnation flux, ballistic coefficient, drag\n- All terms are non-negative, so the cost is at least zero by construction\n- The weight on the drag term selects the regime of the heat-load and drag trade",
