      "id": "recall-methodology-equation-pipeline-cost",
      "section": "RECALL",
      "title": "GOVERNING EQUATION: THE COST FUNCTION",
      "body": "- The cost is a weighted sum of four dimensionless terms\n- Heat load: W_HL times Q over Q_target is the first and heaviest objective\n- Stagnation flux enters through q over q_ref\n- The ballistic coefficient is squared against its reference, drag one sided\n- A penalty term pushes the design back inside the limits of the box",
      "target_position": "the slide right after the cost function, carrying its equation.",
